<title>POLAND: Bank Gdanski plans no 1996 payout.</title>
<headline>Bank Gdanski plans no 1996 payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Bank Gdanski SA plans no 1996 dividend and wants to earmark 80.1 million zlotys of its 1996 net profit for reserve capital and 21.1 million for a risk fund, the bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The management's proposal will be voted on at the company's general shareholders' meeting on June 27.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
